Portions of model.py and bam_actuator.py are adapted from:
- bam/actuator.py (VoltageControlledActuator control and torque equations)
- bam/feetech/actuator.py (HD1910 controller defaults)
- bam/model.py (M6 scalar dry-friction equation, vectorized locally)
- bam/mjlab.py (vectorized friction integration design)

